driver testab

  model test-a
    hardware        2 line keys, 4 softkeys
    display         320x240, service area 298x156
    wallpaper       320x212, thumbnail 80x53
    ringtones       raw µ-law, 8 kHz
    codecs          g722, ulaw, alaw
    config file     SEP{MAC}.cnf.xml
    firmware        TESTA.1-0-0S by default
    labels          screen label at most 12 characters, line label at most 30
    password        12 characters, letters and digits
    resync          by NOTIFY (service-control)
    endpoint        tcp; allow g722, ulaw; qualify off; registration expiry 600s
                    force_rport no, rewrite_contact no, rtp_symmetric no, direct_media no
                    send_rpid yes, send_pai no, trust_id_outbound yes
    pjsip features  supported: hold, wideband
                    untested: transfer
                    unsupported: blf, and every feature not listed

